[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466464512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99001#issuecomment-2466464512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99001","id":2466464512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TA0MA","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-09T21:25:55Z","updated_at":"2024-11-09T21:25:55Z","body":"See: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/90176\r\n\r\nIf you're interested in a PR that allows you to do this see: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93726\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466464512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466658334","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99001#issuecomment-2466658334","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99001","id":2466658334,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TBjge","user":{"login":"ultsi","id":6347200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDcyMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6347200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi","html_url":"https://github.com/ultsi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-10T09:29:32Z","updated_at":"2024-11-10T09:35:30Z","body":"I read through the closed issue, and I still think this is a valid issue for normal users. In my case I created a scene resembling a bullet, tested with `@tool` mode that its velocity is set correctly via export variables etc. in the editor. Then while running the game I created the behavior where the bullet deletes itself after it is a long distance away from its starting point.\r\n\r\nBecause I wrote the auto delete behavior in game with hot reload, the editor didn't crash instantly after adding `queue_free()`. Only the next day, when I came back and started to edit the bullet scene in the editor, the editor started crashing without any obvious reason. Took me an hour to debug the issue.\r\n\r\nI think a fix could be that `queue_free()` throws an error, if it is being used from a tool script, and if it is freeing the scene root.\r\n\r\nOR the editor could crash, but have a message pop up about this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466658334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466662811","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99001#issuecomment-2466662811","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99001","id":2466662811,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TBkmb","user":{"login":"ultsi","id":6347200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDcyMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6347200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi","html_url":"https://github.com/ultsi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ultsi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-10T09:42:29Z","updated_at":"2024-11-10T13:29:44Z","body":"Ah older issues describe that this is something user needs to be aware of: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/26409\r\n\r\nMaintainers: you can close this if you think the same still.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466662811/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2473754940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99001#issuecomment-2473754940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99001","id":2473754940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TcoE8","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-13T14:18:36Z","updated_at":"2024-11-13T14:18:36Z","body":"Yeah this is sadly a case of \"With great power comes great responsibility\". Tool scripts are super powerful but that also implies the power of wreaking havoc in the editor and causing crashes.\r\n\r\nWe're working on a Safe Mode feature which will at least let you recover such crashed projects in a better way (tested with the MRP, it makes it possible to open the project and fix the tool script): #92563.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2473754940/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray"